--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 22d0308a90dc49ae97395f1b651723b5, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_CTX_03_CisoLateJoin
  questionId: CTX-03
  category: 0
  speakerName: Hiring Manager
  questionText: >-
    A CISO joins late, apologizes, and asks for the 'thirty-second version.' The technical team looks annoyed. How do you handle it?
  answerOptions:
  - {fileID: 11400001}
  - {fileID: 11400002}
  - {fileID: 11400003}
  - {fileID: 11400004}
--- !u!114 &11400001
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_CTX_03_A1
  answerText: >-
    Give the executive risk summary, then invite the technical team to validate the assumptions.
  technicalDelta: 1
  commercialDelta: 2
  rapportDelta: 3
  energyDelta: 0
--- !u!114 &11400002
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_CTX_03_A2
  answerText: >-
    Restart from the architecture slide so the CISO has full context.
  technicalDelta: 1
  commercialDelta: -1
  rapportDelta: 0
  energyDelta: -1
--- !u!114 &11400003
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_CTX_03_A3
  answerText: >-
    Ask the CISO which decision they are trying to make today before summarizing.
  technicalDelta: 0
  commercialDelta: 3
  rapportDelta: 2
  energyDelta: 0
--- !u!114 &11400004
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_CTX_03_A4
  answerText: >-
    Keep going with the technical workshop and offer to brief the CISO later.
  technicalDelta: 1
  commercialDelta: 0
  rapportDelta: -1
  energyDelta: 0
